  - Label: ONE ORBIT
    Value: 360 DAYS
  - Label: DISTANCE FROM NEPTUNE
    Value: 5,513,818 KM
  - Label: SURFACE GRAVITY
    Value: NOT MEASURED
  - Label: DISCOVERED
    Value: 1949, GERARD KUIPER
  description: Nereid swings around Neptune on one of the most stretched orbits of any moon, coming seven times closer at one end than at the other. Each lap takes almost a full Earth year.
